        "beforeTransfer(address,address,address)": {
          "notice": "Implement beforeTransfer hook to check if shares are locked, or if `from`, `to`, or `operator` are on the deny list.If share lock period is set to zero, then users will be able to mint and transfer in the same tx.         if this behavior is not desired then a share lock period of >=1 should be used."
        },
